Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.12,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:21.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:33.52,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.84,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.69,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:54.04,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.29,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.61,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.00,0:01:56.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(965,508)\fad(800,800}100 years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.76,0:01:56.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,A hundred years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.36,0:01:58.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,the day when Red Butterfly was born,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.08,0:02:03.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Xue Yue witnessed a rare phenomenon of heaven and earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.04,0:02:06.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Five elemental spirits appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.26,0:02:11.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,They all gathered around the newborn Red Butterfly
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.00,0:02:16.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,and pledged to protect her for life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.84,0:02:18.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,As Red Butterfly grew up,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.48,0:02:23.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,the strength of her elemental spirits increased.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.06,0:02:26.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Such a genius
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.68,0:02:29.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,was a blessing for Xue Yue.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.88,0:02:32.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,I took Red Butterfly as my disciple
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.08,0:02:36.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,in order to investigate the origin of the elemental spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.16,0:02:37.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,But through divination,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.32,0:02:40.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,I foresaw that Red Butterfly
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.24,0:02:43.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,will soon encounter a death disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.76,0:02:49.16,night,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1345,270)\fad(200,500}The night before
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.76,0:02:49.16,night,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1345,340)\fad(200,500}Xue Yue attacks
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.76,0:02:49.16,night,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1400,410)\fad(200,500}the Four Sect Alliance
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.72,0:02:49.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Qing He,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.44,0:02:51.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,in this battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.72,0:02:55.64,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1535,507)\fad(300,300)}Chong Ying\NXue Yue\NLate stage Soul Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.76,0:02:55.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will take Red Butterfly's elemental spirits
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.92,0:02:57.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,and lead our army
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.40,0:02:59.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,in the Four Sect Alliance's territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.60,0:03:01.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.24,0:03:02.08,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1612,501)\fad(300,000)}Qing He\NXue Yue\NLate stage Soul Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.96,0:03:04.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,The other day,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.56,0:03:07.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,red mist envelopped my old body
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.48,0:03:10.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,as I predicted that Red Butterfly's death
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.40,0:03:12.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,will happen in this war.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.28,0:03:16.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you cannot help her overcome her fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.28,0:03:20.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Red Butterfly will be dead by the end of the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.56,0:03:23.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,That way, in the future,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.60,0:03:26.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,she will be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.48,0:03:33.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.68,0:03:37.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Red Butterfly has only been with you for 100 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.36,0:03:40.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.40,0:03:44.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am your first disciple !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.08,0:03:55.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.08,0:03:56.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's wrong ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.20,0:04:02.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,This last divination spell
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.76,0:04:05.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,has exhausted my remaining lifespan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.84,0:04:09.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,But I had no other choice...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.32,0:04:12.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Qing He,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.44,0:04:15.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,don't blame your Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.04,0:04:20.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Xue Yu has been trapped in this barren land
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.36,0:04:22.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,for far too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.00,0:04:26.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,You are now the Elder Sister of Xue Yue.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.24,0:04:28.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Protecting Red Butterfly
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.52,0:04:31.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,also means
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.80,0:04:33.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,protecting our Xue Yue.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.80,0:04:37.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,The future...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.96,0:04:38.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.00,0:04:39.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master !!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.88,0:04:42.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master !!!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.60,0:04:49.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.96,0:04:53.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.36,0:05:06.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Disciple
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.76,0:05:08.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,accepts your order.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.48,0:05:29.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go, go faster !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.04,0:05:50.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,You monsters, get wrecked !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.68,0:06:09.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Lord Envoy,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.16,0:06:11.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,the country of Suzaku promised
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.24,0:06:13.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,that they would help me once.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.64,0:06:15.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,So now...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.12,0:06:17.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please kill this Azure Dragon !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.04,0:06:19.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,She's alive ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.84,0:06:23.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have no right to kill this dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.12,0:06:23.84,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1548,505)\fad(300,000)}Ou Zhi\NEnvoy of the country of Suzaku \NEarly stage Soul Transformation
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.48,0:06:25.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Soul Transformation ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.04,0:06:27.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,But taking out his blood
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.88,0:06:29.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,to stop him from causing trouble,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.68,0:06:31.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,that is something I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.40,0:07:04.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,It turns out our opponent
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.96,0:07:06.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,has never been Red Butterfly...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.14,0:07:09.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,but the country of Suzaku...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.52,0:07:18.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,From now on,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.44,0:07:22.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,you won't have to worry about this dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.76,0:07:34.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Guardian Azure Dragon... has lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.65,0:07:36.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.48,0:07:43.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go ! Quick !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.48,0:07:50.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,With the fall of the Guardian Azure Dragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.64,0:07:52.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Four Sect Alliance has lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.88,0:07:54.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,The outcome of the war is certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.52,0:08:05.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,Five spirits,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.72,0:08:06.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,attack !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.72,0:08:20.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,One is missing ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.92,0:08:50.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Zhou Yun !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.00,0:09:12.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Elder !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.96,0:09:30.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, the Heaven Defying Bead can absorb elemental spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.96,0:09:32.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, I'd have no way to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.72,0:09:37.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Zhou Wutai just left the battlefield...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.08,0:09:40.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is my only chance to get the Rain Cauldron.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.56,0:09:59.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,This domain...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.64,0:10:09.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect to see you here,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.16,0:10:10.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Wang.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.20,0:10:25.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,This Rain Cauldron is too precious
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.96,0:10:27.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,for me to hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.24,0:10:31.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's too precious for our Four Sect Alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.60,0:10:33.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you want it, you can take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.32,0:10:36.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,But whether you can keep it
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.32,0:10:39.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,will depend on your own luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.52,0:10:49.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Take one pill per day
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.96,0:10:51.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,and you will recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.56,0:11:00.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,With the Rain Cauldron in hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.08,0:11:01.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.24,0:11:10.00,Second,,0,0,0,,This is bad !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.84,0:11:11.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,The remnants of the Four Sect Alliance,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.24,0:11:12.44,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1608,503)\fad(300,000)}Lian Ning \NXue Yue Elder\NEarly stage Soul Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.92,0:11:12.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,must die !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.36,0:11:42.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Explode !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.84,0:11:49.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,I won't let you leave !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.92,0:12:08.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although she is Soul Formation,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.16,0:12:11.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,her physical body is not necessarily strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.24,0:12:12.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,With Ancient God blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.36,0:12:14.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,I might have a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.24,0:12:30.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,This Nascent Soul puppet of yours
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.76,0:12:32.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,is pretty interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.96,0:12:45.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Explode !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.12,0:12:51.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I don't escape now,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.72,0:12:53.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will only get harder in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.72,0:12:56.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,The only way to end this quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.96,0:12:58.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,is a tribulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.76,0:13:22.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.40,0:13:24.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Divine Retribution !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.72,0:13:34.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,How can a Nascent Soul brat
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.52,0:13:36.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,summon such a tribulation !?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.96,0:13:42.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fall !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.72,0:14:11.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am Ou Zhi from Suzaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.24,0:14:14.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator, please summon the tribulation again !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.04,0:14:17.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will reward you generously !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.32,0:14:22.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,It really was Divine Retribution...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.62,0:14:23.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.68,0:14:25.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,are you willing to show yourself ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.72,0:14:27.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Killing this one Soul Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.68,0:14:29.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,consumed all my artifacts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.92,0:14:31.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must not interfere
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.56,0:14:32.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,with the country of Suzaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.24,0:14:38.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,The fall of the Guardian Azure Dragon
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.72,0:14:40.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,signed the end of the Four Sect Alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.28,0:14:43.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,The country was destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.32,0:14:45.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the following years,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.20,0:14:51.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,the remaining cultivators of the Four Sects Alliance almost all perished.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.76,0:14:54.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Those who survived
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.08,0:14:55.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,must hide their identity
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.56,0:14:58.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,in the new Xue Yue country
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.36,0:15:01.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,in order to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.00,0:15:09.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(959,489)\fad(800,800}5 years later
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.64,0:15:17.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,After absorbing the earth spirit,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.47,0:15:18.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,the earth element has been completed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.00,0:15:21.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now the Heaven Defying Bead
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.84,0:15:24.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,has a bit of spiritual energy inside it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.88,0:15:27.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,These 5 elemental lights have hints of Life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.88,0:15:30.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Heaven Defying Bead
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.24,0:15:32.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,must have uses I have yet to discover.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.84,0:15:34.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have to complete the 5 elements first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.38,0:15:37.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Only then will the bead recognize me as its master
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.96,0:15:40.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,and maybe reveal its other powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.40,0:15:44.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,To cultivate the Life and Death Domain,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.44,0:15:46.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,the time alteration of the Heaven Defying Bead
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.88,0:15:48.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,is useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.52,0:15:51.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,After 5 years, I cannot stay inside any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.24,0:15:53.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,I still need 4 years
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.12,0:15:56.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,before I can step into Soul Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.04,0:16:05.00,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1587,446)\fad(300,300)}New Xue Yue
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.76,0:16:08.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,In just 5 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.08,0:16:11.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Xue Yue has developed to this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.32,0:16:54.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.68,0:16:56.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,A death aura ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.96,0:16:58.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,There are many mortals here,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.12,0:17:01.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,they should be brimming with life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.07,0:17:05.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,So why is this death aura so prevalent ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.78,0:17:20.66,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I've had my share of wounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.82,0:17:20.66,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}now I want to fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.74,0:17:24.22,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Is my destiny a wall of restrictions
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.30,0:17:30.14,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}that's blocking all my hopes
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.18,0:17:30.14,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}for life ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.94,0:17:35.90,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}My flesh and blood witnessed the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.66,0:17:35.90,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.22,0:17:39.30,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}How do you navigate through the years passing by ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.66,0:17:45.30,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Nirvana and rebirth are no longer
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.38,0:17:45.30,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}out of reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.66,0:17:50.78,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.70,0:17:50.78,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.06,0:17:54.82,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Renegades
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.82,0:17:54.82,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.82,0:17:58.66,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Don't tell me that I overestimate myself
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.77,0:17:58.66,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}and that the path to revenge leads to hell
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.90,0:18:02.78,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}because I don't see the harm in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.78,0:18:10.58,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}My new body opens its eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.30,0:18:10.58,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}and awakens from its dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.70,0:18:18.14,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}I have overcome many trials
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.82,0:18:18.14,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}to get this body back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.34,0:18:25.78,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}No matter how many endless dark nights go by,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.38,0:18:25.78,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}I can still see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.18,0:18:35.14,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}By sticking to this thought, I will get it done
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.14,0:18:35.14,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}by my own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.02,0:19:11.98,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Returning to my body opened my eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.74,0:19:11.98,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}I need to continue my Immortal journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.98,0:19:19.54,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}With a flick of a finger,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.42,0:19:19.54,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}only my indomitable heart remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.58,0:19:28.94,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.54,0:19:28.94,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.18,0:19:36.78,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}Overcome this fate, smash through the obstacles,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.70,0:19:36.78,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}like the descent of a god.
